      "title": "RECOVERY / ASSEMBLE LATER",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "The two amber recovery nodes are MUTED by default.\n\nIf all segments finished but final assembly did not, mute the main green Assemble node, enable both recovery nodes, and queue. They validate every SHA-256 checkpoint pair and assemble without rerendering the completed clips.\n\nFor an interrupted generation, leave recovery muted and set Loop Start's start_clip to the first unfinished clip."
      ],
      "color": "#432f66",
      "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)"
    },
    {
