      "title": "CREDITS / IMPLEMENTATION",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Core MiniMax H3 Image-to-Video conditioning remains owned by ComfyUI. This workflow adds the disk-backed Context Loop plan, continuation, checkpoint, review, recovery, and assembly stages around it.\n\nRecursive GraphBuilder traversal is a specialized MiniMax adaptation of Ethanfel's SxCP loop implementation in ComfyUI-Prompt-Builder.\n\nThe FL2VA prompt follows the bundled H3 prompt-writing format: an exact first/last alignment instruction followed by integrated_multimodal_description, overall_soundscape, and non_diegetic_music."
      ],
      "color": "#432f66",
      "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)"
    },
